            .setMessage("蜈ｨ縺ｦ縺ｮ險ｪ蝠丞ｱ･豁ｴ繧貞炎髯､縺励∪縺吶ゅｈ繧阪＠縺�〒縺吶°��")
            .setPositiveButton("繝ｪ繧ｻ繝�ヨ", (d, w) -> {
                db.resetAll();
                visitedMeshes.clear();
                completedCityMeshes.clear();
                completedCityIds.clear();
                isHeroMode = false;
                boostRadius          = 0f;
                boostRemainingMeshes = 0;
                isTreasureVisible    = false;
                fogProvider.updateSelfWalkedMeshes(visitedMeshes);
